msgid "Emailchef for WooCommerce settings"
msgstr "Impostazioni di Emailchef per WooCommerce"

msgid "Welcome to the Emailchef Integration section for WooCommerce. In this crucial WooCommerce plugin, we offer you the convenience of effortlessly synchronizing your WooCommerce customers with your preferred Emailchef list. By taking advantage of this feature, you will ensure that your email marketing efforts are always up-to-date and targeting the right audience."
msgstr "Benvenuto nelle impostazioni di Emailchef per WooCommerce. Collega i clienti del tuo negozio alla lista Emailchef scelta per mantenere aggiornati i dati dei contatti."

msgid "Emailchef List Settings"
msgstr "Impostazioni della lista Emailchef"

msgid "Simply select the Emailchef list that aligns with your campaign objectives, and the plugin will handle the rest. Our seamless synchronization process automatically updates your chosen list with new users, modifications to existing user information, and any other relevant changes. This not only saves you valuable time but also enhances the effectiveness of your communication strategies."
msgstr "Seleziona la lista Emailchef da collegare. Il plugin aggiornerà automaticamente la lista con i nuovi utenti e le modifiche ai dati dei clienti."

msgid "Emailchef List"
msgstr "Lista Emailchef"

msgid "Select a list..."
msgstr "Seleziona una lista..."

msgid "Add a new Emailchef destination list"
msgstr "Aggiungi una nuova lista Emailchef"

msgid "List name"
msgstr "Nome della lista"

msgid "Provide a name for this new list."
msgstr "Inserisci un nome per la nuova lista."

msgid "List description"
msgstr "Descrizione della lista"

msgid "Provide a description for this new list."
msgstr "Inserisci una descrizione per la nuova lista."

msgid "By setting up a new list within Emailchef, you acknowledge and affirm adherence to Emailchef's <a href=\"https://emailchef.com/privacy-policy/\" target=\"_blank\">privacy policy</a> and <a href=\"https://emailchef.com/terms-of-use/\" target=\"_blank\">terms of use</a>, as well as compliance with the CAN-SPAM Act."
msgstr "Creando una nuova lista in Emailchef, dichiari di rispettare l’<a href=\"https://emailchef.com/privacy-policy/\" target=\"_blank\">informativa sulla privacy</a>, i <a href=\"https://emailchef.com/terms-of-use/\" target=\"_blank\">termini di utilizzo</a> di Emailchef e il CAN-SPAM Act."

